        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Hello, how are you today?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I’m a bit restless, to be honest. I had a weird dream last night and I’m still feeling a bit jittery. I’m hoping talking to you will help me clear my head."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Can you tell me more about it?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "It was just this weird sense of being trapped. I was trying to run, but my legs wouldn't move. It was pretty unsettling."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Did it occur before you fell asleep or after you woke up?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "It started when I was drifting off. I think I must have woken up in a weird state because I couldn't shake it off when I woke up."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Can you connect it to anything that happened to you lately?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Maybe the job interview last week? I keep replaying it in my head, wondering if I messed up."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Is it possible that you did?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don't know, maybe. I just keep thinking I could have done something better."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Was it your decision to look for a new job or you lost previous one?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I got let go, actually. It was a shock. I guess I'm still trying to process it."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How do you feel about it? Did it alter your self-image?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "A bit, yeah. I feel like I should be further ahead by now. It makes me feel a bit... useless."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you think it was your fault?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don't know. I guess I didn't really prepare for it. It was just a shock, you know?"
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Okay. Tell me how do you see yourself now. How would you describe yourself."
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I’m just a bit lost, I guess. I feel like I’m starting over, but I’m not really sure how to do it."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Can we say you don't know what decisions are the best for you right now?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, that’s a big part of it. I feel like I’m just drifting until I figure it out."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Okay. Do you feel like you have energy to make such decisions?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Not really. I just feel flat. I think I need to find a way to get that spark back before I can start making any real progress."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Can you link it to your activity? "
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Maybe. I haven't been doing much besides scrolling on my phone. I probably just need to get out and do something physical."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Are you tired?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, I’m pretty exhausted. I think I just need to force myself to be more productive and stop waiting for the energy to come back."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How about food? Do you eat as much as you used to?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I eat, but it’s just going through the motions. I don’t really enjoy it."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Did the food change its taste?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I guess it’s just... flat. I don’t get the same satisfaction out of it that I used to."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Okay. Tell me about your day. What do you do to relax?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I try to watch a movie or something, but I get restless. I probably just need to find something I enjoy doing again."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "What about hobbies?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I used to do a lot of stuff, but I haven't really had the energy to start anything new. I guess I just need to find something to get me excited again."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you have a partner?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, I do. They’re trying to help me figure things out, but I feel like I’m just holding them back."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Why?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Because I’m just so stuck. I don't know what I want to do, so I feel like I’m wasting their time."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you have sex together?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Not really. It’s just... complicated. I think we both need to figure out our own stuff first."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "If you did, are you interested in such activity?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I guess it’s just... there. I don't really feel it, but I don't want to say no."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "You seem quite sad, aren't you?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah. I am. I just feel like I've lost my way and I don't know how to get back on track."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How long have you felt that way?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Since the job ended, probably. I just feel like I should be further along by now, and I don't know how to catch up."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you think that your job loss is some sort of punishment?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Maybe. I don’t know. It just feels like I messed up and now I have to deal with the consequences."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Let's get back to you. Do you like yourself?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don’t know. I guess I’m just trying to figure out how to be better."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "But does it mean you wouldn't like yourself if it was different person?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Maybe. I don't know. I just feel like I should be more together by now."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "What can you do to achieve it?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don't know. I guess I just need to be more disciplined."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "You said you are sad lately. Have you cried this month?"
