            "content": "Yeah, a few times. I just get really frustrated with myself and I can’t help it."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How about your relations? You told me about your partner but how do you get along with other people?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "It’s okay. I try to be friendly, but I feel like I’m just pretending."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you get into any arguments?"
