        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Not really. I just get quiet and stop talking."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I have one more question. Do not worry, it's normal for psychiatrists to ask it. Did you think about death lately?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, I have. I think about just not being here anymore."
        },
        {
