            "content": "Did you think about killing yourself?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, I have. I just feel like I've wasted so much time already, so I guess I think it’s a shortcut to fixing things."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Did you have feeling that the world would be better without you?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, that’s the worst part. I feel like I’m just holding everyone back, so maybe it would be better if I just wasn't here."
